  1101  p10  paragraph  [p10-l1]  OPP-115
  1102  p10  paragraph  [p10-l2]  Text: Secure Online Ordering For your security, we only store your credit card information if
  1103  p10  paragraph  [p10-l3]  you choose to set up an authorized account with one of our Sites. In that case, it is stored on
  1104  p10  paragraph  [p10-l4]  a secure computer in an encrypted format. If you do not set up an account, you will have to
  1105  p10  paragraph  [p10-l5]  enter your credit card information each time you order. We understand that this may be a little
  1106  p10  paragraph  [p10-l6]  inconvenient for you, but some customers appreciate the added security.
  1107  p10  paragraph  [p10-l7]  Classes: Data Security, User Choice/Control, First Party Collection/Use
  1108  p10  figure  [p10-d2]  
  1109  p10  paragraph  [p10-l9]  Text: Our Use of Web Beacons and Analytics Services Microsoft web pages may contain
  1110  p10  paragraph  [p10-l8]  APP-350
  1111  p10  paragraph  [p10-l10]  electronic images known as web beacons (also called single-pixel gifs) that we use to help
  1112  p10  paragraph  [p10-l11]  deliver cookies on our websites, count users who have visited those websites and deliver
  1113  p10  paragraph  [p10-l12]  co-branded products. We also include web beacons in our promotional email messages or
  1114  p10  paragraph  [p10-l13]  newsletters to determine whether you open and act on them.
  1115  p10  paragraph  [p10-l14]  Classes: Contact_E_Mail_Address, Identifier_Cookie_or_similar_Tech
  1116  p10  figure  [p10-d3]  
  1117  p10  paragraph  [p10-l15]  PrivacyQA Sentence: We may collect and use information about your location (such as your country) or
  1118  p10  paragraph  [p10-l16]  infer your approximate location based on your IP address in order to provide you with tailored
  1119  p10  paragraph  [p10-l17]  educational experiences for your region, but we don’t collect the precise geolocation of you or
  1120  p10  paragraph  [p10-l18]  your device.
  1121  p10  paragraph  [p10-l19]  Question: Does the app track my location? Answer: Relevant
  1122  p10  figure  [p10-d4]  
  1123  p10  paragraph  [p10-l20]  PolicyQA
  1124  p10  paragraph  [p10-l21]  Text: Illini Media never shares personally identifiable information provided to us online in
  1125  p10  paragraph  [p10-l22]  ways unrelated to the ones described above without allowing you to opt out or otherwise
  1126  p10  paragraph  [p10-l23]  prohibit such unrelated uses. Google or any ad server may use information (not including your
  1127  p10  paragraph  [p10-l24]  name, address, email address, or telephone number) about your visits to this and other websites
  1128  p10  paragraph  [p10-l25]  in order to provide advertisements about goods and services of interest to you.
  1129  p10  paragraph  [p10-l26]  Question: Do you share my data with others? If yes, what is the type of data?
