  1322  p13  paragraph  [p13-l20]  that it was specified? For the artifacts you create, do you specify intended use and whether that is
  1323  p13  paragraph  [p13-l21]  compatible with the original access conditions (in particular, derivatives of data accessed for research
  1324  p13  paragraph  [p13-l22]  purposes should not be used outside of research contexts)?
  1325  p13  paragraph  [p13-l23]  In the section "Ethics Statement."
