  224  p3  paragraph  [p3-l29]  Table 1: Structures for Positive Answer
  225  p3  paragraph  [p3-l30]  arate Sentence, and Conjoined Sentence, involve
  226  p3  paragraph  [p3-l31]  two adjacent main clauses. This is followed by two
  227  p3  paragraph  [p3-l32]  structures in which either the VPE or antecedent oc-
  228  p3  paragraph  [p3-l33]  cur in a subordinate clause. There is a Backwards
  229  p3  paragraph  [p3-l34]  structure where the VPE precedes the antecedent;
  230  p3  paragraph  [p3-l35]  here the VPE is in a subordinate clause. Finally, we
  231  p3  paragraph  [p3-l36]  have a Two Actions structure; that is, two ellipsis
  232  p3  paragraph  [p3-l37]  occurrences each with their respective antecedent
  233  p3  paragraph  [p3-l38]  VPs. We have two versions: one in which the target
  234  p3  paragraph  [p3-l39]  question has a correct answer of “Yes", shown in
  235  p3  paragraph  [p3-l40]  table 1, and another where the target question has
  236  p3  paragraph  [p3-l41]  a correct answer of “No", shown in table 2.
  237  p3  paragraph  [p3-l42]  We generate large numbers of examples of each
  238  p3  paragraph  [p3-l43]  structure by performing random substitutions for
  239  p3  paragraph  [p3-l44]  both the subject and verb. The substitution lists are
  240  p3  paragraph  [p3-l45]  given in the appendix, along with samples of each
  241  p3  paragraph  [p3-l46]  structure and the size of the resulting sets. 1
  242  p3  paragraph  [p3-l47]  4 Test
  243  p3  paragraph  [p3-l48]  For each instantiation of a given structure, we pro-
  244  p3  paragraph  [p3-l49]  duce paired ellipsis and non-ellipsis examples, with
  245  p3  paragraph  [p3-l50]  an associated Yes/No question. We randomly select
  246  p3  paragraph  [p3-l51]  1000 examples for each structure, including 500
  247  p3  paragraph  [p3-l52]  ellipsis examples and 500 examples which are their
  248  p3  paragraph  [p3-l53]  non-elliptical counterparts. Each example is pre-
  249  p3  paragraph  [p3-l54]  sented to the system, preceded by the text, “Please
  250  p3  paragraph  [p3-l55]  give a Yes or No answer:". We test five GPT-3 mod-
  251  p3  paragraph  [p3-l56]  els on these structures: Davinci-003, Davinci-002,
