  297  p3  paragraph  [p3-l97]  Curie-001, Babbage-001, and Ada-001. According
  298  p3  paragraph  [p3-l98]  to the GPT-3 documentation, Davinci-003 is the
  299  p3  paragraph  [p3-l99]  most powerful model and Ada-001, the least.
  300  p3  paragraph  [p3-l100]  5 Results
  301  p3  paragraph  [p3-l101]  Figure 1 gives the accuracy for ellipsis and non-
  302  p3  paragraph  [p3-l102]  ellipsis, for each of the five models. We have set
  303  p3  paragraph  [p3-l103]  up the test examples so that an ellipsis example
  304  p3  paragraph  [p3-l104]  is paired with a non-ellipsis example that is oth-
  305  p3  paragraph  [p3-l105]  erwise identical. Because of this, we claim that
  306  p3  paragraph  [p3-l106]  the difference in accuracy of the non-ellipsis case
  307  p3  paragraph  [p3-l107]  vs. the ellipsis case provides a measurement of the
  308  p3  paragraph  [p3-l108]  difficulty specifically posed by ellipsis. For all but
  309  p3  paragraph  [p3-l109]  the least powerful model, Ada, the non-ellipsis ac-
  310  p3  paragraph  [p3-l110]  curacy is substantially higher than ellipsis accuracy,
  311  p3  paragraph  [p3-l111]  supporting the hypothesis that ellipsis-dependent
  312  p3  paragraph  [p3-l112]  reasoning presents a difficult challenge for these
  313  p3  paragraph  [p3-l113]  models. While the Ada model actually performs
  314  p3  paragraph  [p3-l114]  somewhat better for ellipsis than non-ellipsis, this
  315  p3  paragraph  [p3-l115]  is not because the Ada model does well with ellip-
  316  p3  paragraph  [p3-l116]  sis cases; rather, the model has great difficulty with
  317  p3  paragraph  [p3-l117]  both the ellipsis and non-ellipsis cases, and is close
  318  p3  paragraph  [p3-l118]  to a random guessing baseline of .50.
  319  p3  paragraph  [p3-l119]  In figures 2 through 6, we present results for each
  320  p3  paragraph  [p3-l120]  model. We show the accuracy for each structure,
  321  p3  paragraph  [p3-l121]  for both the ellipsis version and the non-ellipsis ver-
  322  p3  paragraph  [p3-l122]  sion. Consider the most powerful models, Davinci-
  323  p3  paragraph  [p3-l123]  003 and Davinci-002. In figures 2 and 3, we can see
  324  p3  paragraph  [p3-l124]  that ellipsis is not difficult in the first two structures:
  325  p3  paragraph  [p3-l125]  2Sent (Separate Sentence) and 1Sent (Conjoined
  326  p3  paragraph  [p3-l126]  Sentence). Here the accuracy is nearly perfect for
  327  p3  furniture  [p3-l127]  41
