  985  p10  paragraph  [p10-l47]  ▷ M is a d × d matrix over a complete semiring
  986  p10  paragraph  [p10-l48]  3:
  987  p10  paragraph  [p10-l49]  M(0) ←− M
  988  p10  paragraph  [p10-l50]  4:
