  993  p10  paragraph  [p10-l55]  for k = 1, . . . , d :
  994  p10  paragraph  [p10-l56]  7:
  995  p10  paragraph  [p10-l57]  M (j)
  996  p10  paragraph  [p10-l58]  ik ←− M (j−1)
  997  p10  paragraph  [p10-l59]  ik
  998  p10  paragraph  [p10-l60]  ⊕ M (j−1)
  999  p10  paragraph  [p10-l61]  ij
  1000  p10  paragraph  [p10-l62]  ⊗ M (j−1)
  1001  p10  paragraph  [p10-l63]  jj
  1002  p10  paragraph  [p10-l64]  ∗
  1003  p10  paragraph  [p10-l65]  ⊗ M (j−1)
