  1020  p11  paragraph  [p11-l3]  algorithm to semirings, as shown in Alg. 5.
  1021  p11  figure  [p11-d1]  
  1022  p11  paragraph  [p11-l4]  Algorithm 5 Faster prefix algorithm over semirings
  1023  p11  figure  [p11-d2]  
  1024  p11  paragraph  [p11-l5]  1: P ′ ←− Lehmann(P)
