  707  p5  paragraph  [p5-l114]  Phys. Rev. B 70, 041303 (2004).
  708  p5  paragraph  [p5-l115]  [51] J.-i. Inoue, T. Kato, Y. Ishikawa, H. Itoh, G. E. W.
  709  p5  paragraph  [p5-l116]  Bauer,
  710  p5  paragraph  [p5-l117]  and L. W. Molenkamp, Phys. Rev. Lett. 97,
  711  p5  paragraph  [p5-l118]  046604 (2006).
  712  p5  paragraph  [p5-l119]  [52] N. A. Sinitsyn, A. H. MacDonald, T. Jungwirth, V. K.
  713  p5  paragraph  [p5-l120]  Dugaev, and J. Sinova, Phys. Rev. B 75, 045315 (2007).
  714  p5  paragraph  [p5-l121]  [53] D. Culcer, A. Sekine, and A. H. MacDonald, Phys. Rev.
