  752  p6  paragraph  [p6-l24]  165117 (2008).
  753  p6  paragraph  [p6-l25]  [61] H. Kontani, T. Tanaka, D. S. Hirashima, K. Yamada,
  754  p6  paragraph  [p6-l26]  and J. Inoue, Phys. Rev. Lett. 102, 016601 (2009).
