  65  p2  figure  [p2-i1]  
  66  p2  paragraph  [p2-l1]  reproducible bug reports. It illustrates several of the features described in the Overview section,
  67  p2  paragraph  [p2-l2]  including the declarative API, semantic mappings, faceting across subplots, aggregation with
  68  p2  paragraph  [p2-l3]  error bars, and visual theme control.
  69  p2  paragraph  [p2-l4]  import seaborn as sns
  70  p2  paragraph  [p2-l5]  sns.set_theme(context="paper")
  71  p2  paragraph  [p2-l6]  fmri = sns.load_dataset("fmri")
  72  p2  paragraph  [p2-l7]  g = sns.relplot(
  73  p2  paragraph  [p2-l8]  data=fmri, kind="line",
  74  p2  paragraph  [p2-l9]  x="timepoint", y="signal",
  75  p2  paragraph  [p2-l10]  hue="event", style="event", col="region",
  76  p2  paragraph  [p2-l11]  height=3.5, aspect=.8,
  77  p2  paragraph  [p2-l12]  )
  78  p2  paragraph  [p2-l13]  g.savefig("paper_demo.pdf")
