  197  p4  paragraph  [p4-l18]  and by the Simons Foundation as a Junior Fellow in the Simons Society of Fellows (527794).
  198  p4  paragraph  [p4-l19]  Many others have helped improve seaborn by asking questions, reporting bugs, and con-
  199  p4  paragraph  [p4-l20]  tributing code; thank you to this community.
